/// Tenant provisioning (implementation)
///
/// Creation of one tenant by the control plane (rec-tenant, keyed by tenant-id; the state of this machine is held in its flow-state field): create the database, apply the layout 5 seconds later (5000 ms, default), install the template 5 seconds after that (5000 ms, default), then report the tenant as active. A failed step undoes what was done and ends in failure; the tenant is never reported active before the layout and the template are in place. One model tick is 2.5 seconds here (timeScale 2500), so the model delay of two ticks is the 5 seconds.
